      "locked": false,
      "text": "A read resolves relational metadata first, then\ndereferences bytes or registry versions. The\ninventory is never rebuilt from a bucket listing.",
      "originalText": "A read resolves relational metadata first, then\ndereferences bytes or registry versions. The\ninventory is never rebuilt from a bucket listing.",
